     letters are ~65% of the art's height — readable at 26dp. Single color so
     Compose can tint it to the bar's titleContentColor in both themes; the
     bolt is knocked out of its disc (evenOdd) the way the monochrome launcher
     icon draws it. Geometry is the banner's 980x470 grid; the group shifts
     the motif's bounding box (70,120)-(913.3,404) to the origin, so the
     viewport hugs the art with no built-in padding. -->
